---
import { buttonVariants } from './ui/button';
---

<div class="photos-locked" data-photos-locked data-reveal>
  <p>照片只给我们俩看，解锁后才能翻看。</p>
  <button class={buttonVariants({ variant: 'default' })} type="button" data-open-login data-needs-js>解锁照片</button>
  <noscript><p>开启 JavaScript 并解锁后，才能看到照片。</p></noscript>
</div>
